{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40235","headline":"和范秘书宿省中作 · 喻坦之","name":"和范秘书宿省中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清省宜寒夜，仙才称独吟。\n钟来宫转漏，月过合移阴。\n鹤避灯前尽，芸高幄外深。\n想知因此兴，暂动忆山心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻坦之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}